TI  - Multimodal Validation in UML Synthesis: A Dual-Case Study on Sequence and Class Diagram Generation Pipelines
AU  - Nguyen, V.-V.
AU  - Nguyen, H.-K.
AU  - Nguyen, K.-S.
AU  - Thi, M.-H.L.
AU  - Bui, A.-T.
AU  - Nguyen, T.-V.
