TI  - Structura-AI: An AI-Powered UML Diagram Generator for Software Engineering Automation
AU  - Krishna Kousik, G.
AU  - Tousef, S.A.
AU  - Ayyapa Reddy, A.V.
AU  - Nair, N.C.
T2  - Procedia Computer Science
