AB  - The AI based crop management and agricultural solutions is an (proposed title) AI-based platform that utilizes machine learning to enable farmers to make data-driven decisions for their crops. It offers crop prediction, fertilizer suggestion, rainfall prediction, and yield prediction based on complex algorithms. It offers direct crop sales with real-time payment through Stripe API, making easy transactions between the consumer and farmer. A chatbot based on OpenAI's GPT-3.5-turbo facilitates user interaction by responding to agriculture-related queries. It also offers weather forecast up to 4 days using OpenWeatherMap API and agricultural news updates using News API to keep the farmer updated. It also offers OTP verification via email for secure payments. Dynamically generated motivational messages using OpenAI's API improve user interaction. The portal has been developed using Python, PHP, Pandas, NumPy, JavaScript, Bootstrap4, and Scikit-learn for maximum performance. The solution empowers farmers with AI-driven insights for maximizing agricultural productivity and sustainability achieve By removing the middle man so the cost of the products was reduce and giving Awareness of Government Schemes and Grants
